  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SOM076N SHO: Support Victims of Famine (Somalia)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Due to the severity of the ongoing drought across Somalia, access to safe drinking water has significantly deteriorated and more than half the country&#x2019;s population is facing acute food insecurity. This project aims to provide emergency relief in the sectors of Water Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) and Food Security and Livelihoods (FSL).</narrative>
  </description>
